{
  "id": "mordekai",
  "name": "Mordecai",
  "title": "Ester's foster father",
  "era": "return",
  "lifespan": "c. 520–440 BC",
  "summary": "Mordecai was a Jewish man in Susa who raised his orphaned cousin Esther. He uncovered a conspiracy against the king and refused to bow down to Haman, which triggered Haman's plan to destroy the Jews. In the end, he was elevated to second-in-command of the Persian Empire.",
